<p>The cottages at Home Farm are conveniently located on the border with Wiltshire and Hampshire, so there are lots of opportunities for things to do and days out.</p>
<p>Enjoy the facilities at <strong>Hamptworth Golf &amp; Country Club</strong>, including: Championship golf course, Padel courts, Pickleball courts, Croquet, Clubhouse, restaurant and bar.</p>
<p>Explore the <strong>New Forest National Park</strong> - walk or cycle through ancient woodland, heathland and open moorland - spot the famous free-roaming ponies, cattle and deer. Visit charming villages, traditional pubs and farm shops. Enjoy picnics, nature trails and scenic viewpoints.</p>
<p>Discover <strong>Salisbury</strong> &amp; its history - visit <strong>Salisbury Cathedral</strong>, home to the tallest church spire in Britain, and one of the best-preserved original copies of the Magna Carta - Visit <strong>Mompesson House</strong>, wander Salisbury''s independent shops, cafes and restaurants or explore <strong>Old Sarum</strong>, one of southern England''s most important historic sites, with its impressive ancient earthworks and panoramic views.</p>
<p>Discover Wiltshire''s World Heritage Sites - visit the iconic <strong>Stonehenge</strong>, and explore <strong>Avebury</strong>, home to the world''s largest prehistoric stone circle, and discover the rich ancient history that makes this UNESCO World Heritage landscape so special.</p>
<p>Take a trip to <strong>Shaftesbury</strong> and see the famous <strong>Gold Hill</strong>, featured in the classic Hovis advert.</p>
<p>For gardens, heritage &amp; historic houses visit the magnificent gardens at <strong>Stourhead</strong>, explore the picturesque village and historic buildings of <strong>Lacock Abbey</strong>, and wander the beautiful rose gardens and grounds at <strong>Mottisfont</strong>.</p>', 50.9622, -1.7347, NULL, 1, 'Each cottage includes a complimentary welcome hamper with a selection of teas, coffee, fresh milk and biscuits for guests to enjoy during their stay.', NULL, '<p>Each cottage includes a complimentary welcome hamper with a selection of teas, coffee, fresh milk and biscuits for guests to enjoy during their stay.</p>', '["6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb0","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb1","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb2","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb3","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb4","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb5","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb6","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fb7","6ac3e2bded148dd299f90fb8","6ac3e2bded148dd299f90fb9","6ac3e2bded148dd299f90fba","6ac3ece4f55bc9c9731d99e3","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90fa7","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90fa8","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90fa9","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90faa","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90fab","6ac3e2bbed148dd299f90fac","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fad","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90fae","6ac3e2bced148dd299f90faf","1af5d93f980aec69f00aa837","f6632456e87c9c5265df2836"]', '[{"url":"https://www.newforestnpa.gov.uk/","name":"New Forest National Park","description":"Walking & cycling","imageMediaId":null},{"url":null,"name":"Hamptworth Golf & Country Club","description":"Golf, dining & clubhouse","imageMediaId":null},{"url":"https://www.salisburycathedral.org.uk/","name":"Salisbury Cathedral","description":"Historic landmark","imageMediaId":null},{"url":"https://www.english-heritage.org.uk/visit/places/stonehenge/","name":"Stonehenge","description":"World heritage site","imageMediaId":null}]', 2, 1, 1, 'ACTIVE', NULL, '2026-10-05 19:46:26.000', '2026-10-27 04:03:27.000') ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `property_id`=VALUES(`property_id`), `name`=VALUES(`name`), `slug`=VALUES(`slug`), `short_description`=VALUES(`